# #244/#257 positive native witness for the polity dispatch window contract.
# The production founding transaction founds a population-0 camp. Its first daily pass raises the
# rite ground, so every later daily pass changes the camp's endpoint facts (that work row's read
# tick): before the fix, days 2-7 of every window refused reconciliation.
# Each advance crosses exactly one day boundary and is followed by a read-only witness that
# journals the realm's dispatch receipt as one polity-dispatch row. A new game starts on a random
# day (XRLGame.CreateNewGame), so the first pass may fall on any day of its 8400-tick window;
# eleven daily witnesses guarantee that some window is read three times in a row (two
# later-in-window passes) and that a newer window opens after them, whatever the start phase.
# CHECK=polity-window asserts constant receipts inside a window and a committed advance at the
# boundary; LOG_FORBID asserts zero reconciliation refusals and no withdrawn intent. LOG_REQUIRE
# asserts the heart's first rung, so the camp has the rite-ground work row whose readings drift
# (a world whose rite slot is liquid fails here instead of passing without that drift), and the
# drift line, logged at most once per window per loaded game (any load may log it again).
# No synthetic citizens, stores, clock checkpoints or dispatch writes. No save/load, cold load,
# second city, zone re-entry or scheduled-cohort presentation claim; those stay owed elsewhere.
DESCRIPTION=daily polity reconciliations keep one frozen window receipt through fact drift and advance at the window boundary
REQUEST=founding-first-city
START=8.22@40,12
SCRIPT=stagedigest;realize;advance 1200;polity-window-check;advance 1200;polity-window-check;advance 1200;polity-window-check;advance 1200;polity-window-check;advance 1200;polity-window-check;advance 1200;polity-window-check;advance 1200;polity-window-check;advance 1200;polity-window-check;advance 1200;polity-window-check;advance 1200;polity-window-check;advance 1200;polity-window-check;stagedigest
VERBS=polity-window-check
EXPECT=stagedigest:OK~founded=false,realize:OK,advance:OK,polity-dispatch:OK~window=,polity-window-check:OK~recorded polity-dispatch window=,advance:OK,polity-dispatch:OK~window=,polity-window-check:OK~recorded polity-dispatch window=,advance:OK,polity-dispatch:OK~window=,polity-window-check:OK~recorded polity-dispatch window=,advance:OK,polity-dispatch:OK~window=,polity-window-check:OK~recorded polity-dispatch window=,advance:OK,polity-dispatch:OK~window=,polity-window-check:OK~recorded polity-dispatch window=,advance:OK,polity-dispatch:OK~window=,polity-window-check:OK~recorded polity-dispatch window=,advance:OK,polity-dispatch:OK~window=,polity-window-check:OK~recorded polity-dispatch window=,advance:OK,polity-dispatch:OK~window=,polity-window-check:OK~recorded polity-dispatch window=,advance:OK,polity-dispatch:OK~window=,polity-window-check:OK~recorded polity-dispatch window=,advance:OK,polity-dispatch:OK~window=,polity-window-check:OK~recorded polity-dispatch window=,advance:OK,polity-dispatch:OK~window=,polity-window-check:OK~recorded polity-dispatch window=,stagedigest:OK~founded=true,COMPLETE
CHECK=polity-window
LOG_FORBID=["polity: daily reconciliation refused","polity: zone reconciliation refused","polity: active load reconciliation refused"," withdrawn: "]
LOG_REQUIRE=["heart rung raised: 1 ("," continues with endpoint facts changed since it opened; no new dispatch until window "]
SET=polity,native-regression
TIMEOUT=1200
